<rml>
<head>
	<!--
		The elevator's prompt (I4 step 7b; ADR-0013 §10: a proximity zone with a prompt): shown while the walker stands
		in front of a floor's elevator in free roam, it names the key or button that opens the directory there (the
		interact action's: E, the pad's A). Bound to the data model "elevator_prompt" of rv::app::ElevatorPromptPanel
		(src/app/src/elevator_prompt_panel.cpp), which also names the ids below: keep them in step
		(src/app/include/rv/app/elevator_prompt_ui.hpp, tests/unit/app/test_elevator_prompt_document.cpp).
		key: the key's or the button's name (data, not a sentence of the UI). It takes no input and never the focus.
	-->
	<title>Ascensore</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="elevator_prompt.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="elevator_prompt">
	<div id="elevator-prompt">
		<span class="prompt">
			<span class="name">Ascensore</span>
			<span class="key">{{ key }}</span>
			<span class="action">Scegli il piano</span>
		</span>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
